Fall festivities and good company! 🍂

Our Greenville Women's Initiative hosted an Autumn Social, bringing together women from across the industry for an evening of fun, conversation, and new connections! From supporting Shepherd's Gate, a local women's shelter, to treating our guests to goodies from Betel Botanical Soap Studio, it was a wonderful evening celebrating and supporting women.

Thank you to everyone who joined us!

